              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "图 3-64 细菌视紫红质分子的三维结构（引自 Alberts et al., 2015）。以  "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "\\alpha"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "  螺旋 7 次穿膜的视紫红质多肽链。图中标出了发色团所在的部位及光激活引起  "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "H^{+}"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": " 循环的可能途径。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
